#: core/help_topics.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Moves Z up and down around the current position and scores the sharpness of the centre of the "
"image at each stop. It first searches ±{coarse_range_um:g} µm in {coarse_step_um:g} µm steps, "
"widening the search (up to {max_coarse_passes} times) while the sharpest point is at the edge of "
"the range, then refines it with ±{fine_range_um:g} µm in {fine_step_um:g} µm steps.\n"
"Needs the camera stream running and a sample with visible detail. While it runs, an AUTOFOCUS "
"badge is shown on the preview, the camera controls are locked and the progress is written to the "
"log."
msgstr ""

#: core/help_topics.py
msgid "Choose the camera and how it is read, then start the live preview."
msgstr ""

