#: core/help_topics.py
msgid "Resolution"
msgstr ""

#: core/help_topics.py
msgid ""
"If the camera cannot provide it, the driver picks a nearby size. Lower resolutions give a higher "
"frame rate and smaller files. Snapshots and recordings use the size of the frames actually "
"received."
msgstr ""

#: core/help_topics.py
msgid ""
