#: core/help_topics.py
msgid "Physical calibration"
msgstr ""

#: core/help_topics.py
msgid ""
"Pixels alone say nothing about real size: you need a reference. Image a stage micrometer (a slide"
" with a ruler), measure how many pixels a known distance covers and enter the µm per pixel.\n"
"The value only holds for this objective and camera resolution: change either and measure again."
msgstr ""

